.34-2.15-6.51-2.99-12.61-6.18-18.87-9.48-6.16,6.98-12.16,14.49-17.54,21.84-2.56-6.72-3.73-13.76-3.43-20.76-10.39,3.97-16.37,12.8-18.95,21.6-1.11,3.8-1.71,7.8-.41,11.56s4.82,7.24,9.66,8.23c-7.25,2.74-15.12,5.49-23.06,6.57,3.91,2.64,9.19,4.03,14.36,3.77,5.17-.26,10.17-2.17,13.61-5.19-1.58,3.2-2.82,6.29-4.4,9.49,6.47-.33,11.4-4.48,15.61-8.32.67-.62,2.74-2.53,1.71-2.62Z" style="fill: #657e89;"/>\n</svg>','\n',char(10)), 'Logan is a clever but reckless raccoon who got pulled into something way over his head.', replace('<strong>Logan</strong> is a clever but extremely reckless raccoon who stumbled into something way over his head. He''s a bit of a dork, but he''s got a good heart and a knack for getting out of tight situations... usually by the skin of his teeth, despite his near-total lack of self-restraint. If it weren''t for that damn book, he probably would''ve just been a random tech-obsessed raccoon.\n\n[[NSFW]]During his later years, he goes down a bit of a dark path of self-indulgence eventually leading to his downfall as a functioning member of society. Leaning too far hard down an addictive path of his weight gain fetish, he sits alone in his house, unable to move without assistance.[[/NSFW]]','\n',char(10)), 'Character', '["character","logan-foster","raccoon","furry","redrift"]', 'both', 0, '2026-04-16T00:00:00Z', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
