>\n  <polygon points="48.7 104.95 52.29 102.4 56.83 106.76 52.77 104.58 48.7 104.95" style="opacity: .4;"/>\n  <polygon points="82.27 104.95 78.68 102.4 74.14 106.76 78.21 104.58 82.27 104.95" style="opacity: .4;"/>\n  <polygon points="58.81 100.88 72.16 100.88 67.62 98.33 65.14 89.26 63.45 98.33 58.81 100.88" style="opacity: .4;"/>\n  <path d="M62.82,51s-.87-15.46,5.17-21.52c4.63,8.72,6.15,27.78,6.15,27.78,0,0-3.86-18.79-6.5-22.33-1.28,4.63-4.82,16.07-4.82,16.07Z" style="fill: #19326f;"/>\n</svg>','\n',char(10)), 'Jason is a wildly overconfident and aggressive shark mercenary whose boundless bravado almost always gets him into trouble.', 'Twin brother to [Zeke](/wiki/zeke-harborne), <strong>Jason</strong> is a wildly overconfident and aggressive shark mercenary whose boundless bravado almost always gets him into trouble. He refuses to admit it, but he definitely peaked in high school, and even then, he was unbearable.', 'Character', '["shark","jason-skank","redrift"]', 'both', 2, '2026-04-20T05:36:44.465Z', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
